[DEBUG INVESTIGATION REPORT]
Issue: When JWT tokens expired after 7 days or when localStorage credentials were wiped, frontend API requests to /api/v1/favorites or /api/v1/auth/me hung or failed without notifying the UI state.
Diagnosis: server/middleware/auth.js previously returned 401, but the frontend did not catch token expiration specifically, causing stale token re-use.
Resolution:
1. Enhanced server/middleware/auth.js with explicit JsonWebTokenError and TokenExpiredError branch handling.
2. Updated client musicService.js fetch API wrapper to intercept 401 responses, clear obsolete tokens from localStorage, and trigger clean guest mode fallback.
3. Added automated unit and integration tests (server/tests/api.test.js Tests 2.2 and 2.7).
Status: RESOLVED & VERIFIED.
